capability sanitize/classes  the classes an element keeps, by name
  heroes  html/sanitize.allow_classes
  go      Policy.AllowStyling
  rust    Builder::allowed_classes, Builder::add_allowed_classes, Builder::rm_allowed_classes
  python  nh3.clean(allowed_classes=)
